A: If a[ writer] is using an elaborate, baroque[ style]…or a very clean, spare[ style], I do my[ best] to[ write] that kind of[ English]. I’m trying to allow the reader in[ English] to experience the text in a way that’s comparable to the way the Spanish-language reader experiences it.
